            "answer": {
              "short": "$4$",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f(0)&=0+2\\\\f(0)&=2\\\\f(f(0))&=f(2)\\\\f(f(0))&=2+2\\\\f(f(0))&=4\\end{align*}$$",
