              "short": "$7$",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f(3)&=3+2\\\\f(3)&=5\\\\f(f(3))&=f(5)\\\\f(f(3))&=5+2\\\\f(f(3))&=7\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
