              "short": "$3$",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f(-1)&=-1+2\\\\f(-1)&=1\\\\f(f(-1))&=f(1)\\\\f(f(-1))&=1+2\\\\f(f(-1))&=3\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 23
          },
          {
