              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f(-8)&=-8+2\\\\f(-8)&=-6\\\\f(f(-8))&=f(-6)\\\\f(f(-8))&=-6+2\\\\f(f(-8))&=-4\\end{align*}$$",
